  "source_rule": "Genuine SourceCore profile must never receive bootstrap primitive constant fallback; actual source declarations/initializers own values.",
  "scope": "Only char MIN/MAX plus unchanged integer MAX. Float constants and reference-RHS Add/Sub remain required.",
  "native": "Only accepted ordinary inputs execute; clean exit0/empty stdout/stderr. Char scalar is four bytes; casts retain their actual target widths.",
  "source_profile_placement": "SourceCore producer/ownership controls reside at PA31; byte-identical relocation preserves earlier predictions and raw diagnostic paths."
